Drop a preview image here for each playlist, named after its "slug" from
assets/data/playlists.json — e.g. electrical-power-engineering.jpg

Supported extensions: .jpg, .jpeg, .png (checked in that order).
If a matching file exists, it's used as the card thumbnail automatically.
If not, the site falls back to fetching the real YouTube thumbnail, and
if that's unavailable too, falls back to the plain color-gradient card.

Current slugs (see assets/data/playlists.json):
- electrical-power-engineering
- lighting-design-dialux-evo
- theoretical-calculation-lighting-design
- electrical-engineering
- power-system-planning
- signals-and-systems
- power-factor-correction
- infrastructure
